> I have a question. I have the RKward configuration. I don't know what
>  happened but now when I open R I have in my workspace data frames which I
>  used in the past sessions...I'm quite sure that I dident save them.How can
>  I set  RKward in order to open a new workspace?

look for a (hidden) file named ".RData" in the directory you started rkward 
from (your home directory, when starting rkward from the menu). Move / remove 
this file.

(This behavior should really be configurable, and default to not restoring the 
.RData-workspace - but that's for a future release).

Regards
Thomas
